# Hotel PMS — Elektraweb live bridge

**Operator / engineer guide:** [doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md](../../doc/ELEKTRAWEB-LIVE-BRIDGE.md)  
**Extension install + settings:** [extensions/elektraweb-bridge/README.md](../../extensions/elektraweb-bridge/README.md)  
**ADR inbound:** [docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-live-bridge.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-live-bridge.md)  
**ADR reverse extras:** [docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-reverse-folio-post.md](../../../docs/adr/hotel-elektraweb-reverse-folio-post.md)  
**SaaS Wave 1:** [docs/adr/saas-request-tenant-and-vendor-bridges.md](../../../docs/adr/saas-request-tenant-and-vendor-bridges.md)

## Tenant binding (Wave 1)

| Source of truth | Mechanism |
|-----------------|-----------|
| ERA org | JWT / session / outbox body `organizationId` → `enterSatelliteTenant` |
| Elektraweb property | `ElektrawebBridgePolicy` for that org (Super-Admin + Sync) |
| Bridge JWT | embeds org + policy hotel id; ingest 409 if row `HOTELID` mismatches policy |
| Appliance login without org | `getUserByLogin` scoped to process bind only |

## Auth

- Options login → `POST /api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/login` with `organizationId`
- Ingest Bearer: bridge JWT or staff session JWT (no process-wide shared token)
- Process kill: `ELEKTRAWEB_BRIDGE_ENABLED=1`
- Org write: policy `inboundEnabled` + `writeEnabled`
- Extension: `deskRole` (`hotel_fo` \| `sanatorium`), inbound, write (sanatorium only)

## API

| Method | Route |
|--------|-------|
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/login` |
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge` |
| GET | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/health` |
| GET | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/outbox` (JWT; claims PENDING for JWT org) |
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/outbox` (POS secret or JWT; **requires** `organizationId`) |
| POST | `/api/integrations/elektraweb-bridge/outbox/[id]/ack` |

Lifecycle on status-diff: `guest-lifecycle-events.ts` (not full native check-in posting).
